content.text:
Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "IN",
    "trade": "batik print fabric",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "INR"
  },
  "hinglish": true,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "unverifiable",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "12 May 2025\n10:04 Mira: Hi, indigo batik print fabric available hai?\n10:07 Kavya: Haan, cotton mein available hai. How much do you need?\n10:09 Mira: Please send 6 metres, all in the same print.\n10:12 Kavya: Done. Fabric INR 4,200 and shipping INR 600. Total INR 4,800.\n10:14 Mira: Theek hai, INR 4,800 works for me. Please invoice me through PayPal.\n10:16 Kavya: Sure. I will book India Post after payment and share the booking details.\n10:18 Mira: Thanks! Please fold the fabric carefully; it's for a small sewing project."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller's invoice",
      "text": "INVOICE\nIssued: 12 May 2025\nSeller: Kavya Neral\nBuyer: Mira Velan\n\nIndigo batik print cotton fabric, 6 metres: INR 4,200\nInternational shipping: INR 600\nTotal: INR 4,800\n\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe fabric will be packed folded in a protective wrapping. Shipping is to the delivery details supplied separately by the buyer. Any import charges at destination are the buyer's responsibility. Please check the quantity and print description before payment; contact the seller if anything needs changing. Dispatch will be arranged after payment is received."
    },
    {
      "title": "Courier booking",
      "text": "INDIA POST — BOOKING RECEIPT\nBooking date: 14 May 2025\nSender: Kavya Neral\nRecipient: Mira Velan\nContents: Cotton fabric, 6 metres\nService: International tracked parcel\nPostage paid: INR 600\n\nThe tracking number is printed on the separate counterfoil, which is not included in this copy. Keep the counterfoil until the parcel reaches the recipient. Delivery times are estimates and depend on destination processing and customs clearance. The sender should retain the packing record and share the tracking details with the recipient from the counterfoil. No delivery confirmation is included on this booking receipt."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: INR 4,800",
      "value": "INR 4,800"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: 6 metres of indigo batik print cotton fabric",
      "value": "6 metres of indigo batik print cotton fabric"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 12 May 2025",
      "value": "12 May 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Mira Velan",
      "value": "Mira Velan"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking_number: tracking number of the parcel",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: India Post",
      "value": "India Post"
    }
  ]
}
